<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Learner paper · 繁體</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Learner paper · 繁體</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the man do next?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 換貓的水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 交備用鑰匙</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 準備貓糧</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When does the teacher-led pet-care activity start?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How long does the speaker normally take the dog out each time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四十分鐘</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩個小時</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二十分鐘</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Which class can the woman try within her available time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 週二游泳課</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 週三游泳課</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 週三籃球課</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. What does Xiaoding’s preparation suggest he has learned?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打球要記得帶水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球鞋完全不需要帶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 打完球也不會口渴</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. At which part of the sports centre will they meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 游泳館裏面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中心外的商店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 籃球館門口</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Which means of transport do they choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 等公交車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 坐出租車</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 騎自行車</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What is the first step after entering the west gate?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 向食堂左轉</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 穿過小廣場</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去停車場</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which bus fits the man’s arrival and luggage needs?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六路車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十路車</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 兩路車都來不及</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What is the updated training arrangement?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 早上八點在學校球場</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三點在學校球場</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 早上八點在體育館</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many cartons of juice will they bring?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 兩盒</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which mat will suit the woman’s group?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩人用的小號</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 只要藍色小號</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四人用的大號</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How much must the student pay?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五塊</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which bag meets both practical requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 丙包</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 甲包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙包</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What must the man do before going to play ball?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 把鑰匙交給王阿姨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 帶着鑰匙等到七點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自己六點回家喂貓</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. How will the afternoon compare with the morning?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 更涼快</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一直有大風</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 熱得多</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why has the match been moved to the evening?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午沒有場地</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午太熱</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上門票更便宜</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which activity fits both of the stated limits?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 半小時跑步課</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五十分鐘投籃課</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 九十分鐘游泳課</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the group do directly after watching the boats?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 聽老師講故事</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 學做香包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 送禮物給弟弟</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What can we infer about Xiaofang by the end?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她仍然完全不會做</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她只想讓老師代做</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她對自己更有信心了</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What should Xiaoning do after school?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">給小寧的留言<br>兔子的晚飯我已經放在盒子裏，六點開盒子就可以。今天放學後，請你先把空水瓶裝滿。兔籠我早上已經打掃過了，不用再打掃，也不要另外買飼料。<br>爸爸</p></div><p class="note">兔籠: rabbit cage</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 重新打掃兔籠</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 給水瓶裝水</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去買飼料</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the explanatory talk begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">課後寵物小組<br>週五三點半開門，四點開始講解。四點半大家練習怎樣給貓梳毛，五點離開。第一次來的同學請三點四十前到，先登記姓名，不要把到場時間當成講解開始時間。</p></div><p class="note">梳毛: brush fur</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三點四十</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午四點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How long is each outing with the dog?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">照顧小狗的約定<br>這個星期，小安每天放學後帶小狗出去十五分鐘，回來再準備自己的晚飯。星期三雖然放學晚，也照常出去十五分鐘。週末改由哥哥照顧，但每次時間仍然一樣。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三十分鐘</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一小時</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十五分鐘</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which class matches Xiao’an’s day and learning goal?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的選課卡<br>本週只有週一下午能參加活動，想學球類運動。運動中心週一有羽毛球課、週二有籃球課，週一另有繪畫課。三種課都不需要以前學過，費用也都一樣。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 週二籃球課</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 週一繪畫課</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 週一羽毛球課</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which preparation is supported by Xiaoning’s record?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">運動後的記錄<br>以前小寧一打完球就趕着回家，書包裏也總忘放水。昨天教練提醒他帶水，並在結束後坐一會兒。他照着做了，回家路上說比以前輕鬆，打算下次也提前準備。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 帶水並留一點休息時間</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 結束後馬上跑回家</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把水留在家裏</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should the group meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">集合消息<br>運動中心裏有游泳館、籃球館和網球場。本週小組的球拍課在網球場，大家直接在那裏集合，不用先去售票處等。游泳館今天只對學校開放，籃球館下午有比賽。</p></div><p class="note">售票處: ticket office</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 網球場</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 游泳館</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 售票處</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. How is the group asked to travel?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小組交通約定<br>教練會用小巴接大家到運動中心，車上可以放球拍。請九點在學校南門等，不用自己騎車。我們到了中心還要一起檢查器材，所以先別一個人提前過去。</p></div><p class="note">器材: equipment</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 各自騎車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 各自提前坐地鐵</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乘教練的小巴</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What should visitors pass first after entering?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">運動中心入口圖說明<br>由北門進入後，先經過小花園，到服務檯領取活動卡，再按藍色箭頭上二樓。練習館就在樓梯右邊。沒有活動卡不能進館，請不要進門就直接上樓。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二樓練習館</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小花園</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 樓梯右側</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which entrance lets Xiaohe enter before the stated deadline?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">運動中心入口卡<br>東門九點開放，從車站步行十五分鐘。西門十點開放，從車站步行五分鐘。小何九點下車，要在九點半前進場。進門以後到教室的路程一樣，他不能等到十點。</p></div><p class="note">步行: on foot</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 西門</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 東門</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 兩個門都來不及</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. What will the group now do at two in the afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">運動中心活動更新<br>週六下午太熱，原定兩點在室外參觀球場的活動取消，改看一樓展廳裏的運動照片展。開始時間仍是下午兩點，不需要去游泳館集合。請把這條新消息告訴其他同學。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 在室外參觀球場</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在一樓展廳看照片展</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在游泳館集合</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many cartons of juice are listed?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐裝箱單<br>果汁五盒，牛奶兩盒，麪包三袋。小林帶果汁，小陳帶麪包，老師帶牛奶。名單上有五位同學，每個人可以拿一盒果汁；牛奶是留給另外兩位幫忙的家長的。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五盒</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which size should the group choose?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">用品卡<br>小號墊：兩個人坐，收起來放進書包。<br>大號墊：四個人坐，需要單獨拿。<br>這次四位同學只有一張墊子的預算，大家都想坐在墊子上，不能再借別人的墊子。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩人坐的小號</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四人坐的大號</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 兩張小號</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. Which amount is the non-refundable one-day usage fee?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐籃租用單<br>一天使用費十元，另交押金二十元。小何先付三十元，店員說明：按時還回完整的籃子，就退二十元押金；十元使用費不退。小何打算當天傍晚按時歸還。</p></div><p class="note">押金: refundable deposit</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三十元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which package fits the facilities described in the note?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐準備<br>公園沒有廚房，也沒有冰箱。甲套餐是需要加熱的生餃子；乙套餐是麪包和洗好的蘋果，不用加熱也不用冷藏；丙套餐要一直冷藏。小組要在公園待三小時，只能帶一套。</p></div><p class="note">冷藏: keep refrigerated</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲套餐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 丙套餐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙套餐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What has Xiao’an agreed to do immediately after class?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭羣消息<br>媽媽今天五點到家，小安四點半下課，哥哥六點回來。小狗五點以前要有人接回家。媽媽說自己趕不上，小安答應放學直接去接，哥哥回來以後再帶狗出去走走。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 接小狗回家</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 等哥哥六點回來</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先回家等媽媽</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. How is the afternoon expected to compare with early morning?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">週日天氣表<br>早晨二十三度，微風；下午三十六度，無風；晚上二十七度。運動中心提醒：下午來上課請帶水，不要把早晨的涼快當成全天的天氣，室外活動儘量避開午後。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 更熱，而且沒有風</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 更涼快，風更大</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 溫度完全一樣</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why is the lesson now in the morning?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">課程羣消息<br>週二籃球課本來四點開始，現改爲上午九點。球場沒有比賽，也沒有維修。老師說下午太熱，希望大家在太陽還不強的時候練習。報名和上課地點都不用改變。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 球場下午有比賽</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球場需要維修</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 避開下午的高溫</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which plan follows the coach’s practice-and-rest requirement?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">訓練安排卡<br>教練要求小林每練習二十分鐘，至少休息五分鐘再繼續。<br>甲：連續練四十分鐘。乙：練二十分鐘，休息五分鐘，再練二十分鐘。丙：練二十分鐘，休息一分鐘，再繼續練。小林要選符合要求的安排。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What must visitors do just after collecting the activity card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">端午活動須知<br>進門先領取活動卡，再到服務桌蓋章。拿到蓋章的卡纔可以換一份手工材料。完成香包後可以在出口拍照。沒有蓋章不能領材料，請不要直接到出口排隊。</p></div><p class="note">蓋章: stamp</p><p class="note">香包: sachet</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 直接領取手工材料</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 到服務桌蓋章</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去出口拍照</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiaohe’s later behaviour suggest?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小何的端午活動記錄<br>我第一次來，找不到做香包的教室，工作人員帶我過去。活動結束後，我看見新來的同學也在找教室，就陪他走過去，還留在門口給後面的人指路，直到大家都進了教室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 他願意幫助不熟悉活動的人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 他只想早點獨自離開</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 他一直沒有找到教室</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to a sports schedule conflict</h2><p>Reply to Xiaoyu in Chinese. Answer whether you can attend the new badminton session on Tuesday at five and say whether you can bring a racket. Give one reason connected to your availability or equipment. Suggest a workable alternative or ask a relevant question. Invent details if needed. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小何：週三的羽毛球課取消了，小組想改到週二下午五點。你能參加嗎？你能帶球拍來嗎？如果不方便，我們再想別的辦法。<br>小雨</p></div><ul><li>Answer whether Tuesday at five works for you.</li><li>Say whether you can bring a racket.</li><li>Give a reason related to availability or equipment.</li><li>Suggest a feasible alternative or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Tell a classmate about a short trip</h2><p>Use the fictional trip card to describe last Sunday in Chinese. Include when and where the trip happened, at least two actions in a consistent order, and a feeling or reason. You may add plausible details. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">時間：上週日<br>地點：城外的小湖<br>早上：全班坐小巴出發<br>到達後：老師帶大家沿湖看鳥<br>中午：在樹下喫自帶的午飯<br>下午：整理垃圾，再坐車返校<br>感受：自己選擇並說明</p></div><ul><li>Identify last Sunday.</li><li>Identify the lake outside town.</li><li>Describe one action on the card.</li><li>Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give a feeling or a reason.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Arrange a sports-centre visit</h2><p>A classmate is arranging a visit to the sports centre. Answer four fixed recorded prompts in Chinese. Each prompt plays twice, followed by 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Use real or invented details. Four responses are reviewed together as one task out of eight; these prompts are not adaptive.</p><p>Discuss equipment needs, choose an activity, explain your choice, and handle a changed meeting point.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Compare two short trips</h2><p>Recommend one of the two short trips to a classmate who must be back at school by three on Sunday and has forty yuan. Compare the options, state a choice, give two reasons supported by the cards and explain a short plan. If you choose an option with a difficulty, explain how you would manage it. Prepare for 60 seconds and speak for up to 90 seconds.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">週日短途選擇<br>甲：學校組織的小湖活動，上午九點出發、下午兩點回校，三十五元含往返車費，需要自帶午飯。<br>乙：鄰城公園，上午十點出發、下午四點回校，二十元含往返車費和午飯；可以提前離開，但提前返程的車費另算，金額未知。<br>同學：下午三點前必須回校，預算四十元，家中已準備好可帶走的午飯。</p></div><ul><li>Compare one or more features of both trips.</li><li>Choose a trip.</li><li>Give a first supported reason.</li><li>Give a second supported reason.</li><li>Describe a feasible short plan, including how to handle any chosen constraint.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>